---
description: >-
  Verifies the flowchart.inheritDir option: subgraph B declares no explicit
  direction of its own, so it should inherit the outer flowchart's LR direction,
  while sibling subgraph A explicitly overrides with its own TB direction.
config:
  fontFamily: courier
---
%%{init: {"flowchart": { "inheritDir": true }}}%%
flowchart TB
  direction LR
  subgraph A
  direction TB
  a --> b
  end
  subgraph B
  c --> d
  end
